      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是之后打算前进德比，\n参加“樱花赏”这个选择相当不智。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0517654168f8ac57fa566f28e4670806afe380d139772f6098ab95414b8118b4",
